# Play Logicers: how long browsers keep the static files (Workers static assets read this file).
# Every page asks for /a/ files with a stamp (?v=… from npm run stamp) and the fonts carry a version in their names,
# so a changed file always has a new address and a year is safe.
/a/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
